{"title": "Missile Snaring", "pageid": 28312, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Missile_Snaring", "categories": ["Class actions", "Reactions", "Sources of damage reduction"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles\" title=\"Deflect Missiles\">Deflect Missiles</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Deflect_Missiles.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Deflect_Missiles.webp/300px-Deflect_Missiles.webp, /w/images/0/04/Deflect_Missiles.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Deflect_Missiles.webp/300px-Deflect_Missiles.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Deflect_Missiles.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Missile Snaring</b> is a passive feature/reaction granted by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring\" title=\"Gloves of Missile Snaring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring\" title=\"Gloves of Missile Snaring\">Gloves of Missile Snaring</a> which allows the wearer to spend a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> to intercept a ranged attack and reduce its damage. \n<p>It is very similar to the monk's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles\" title=\"Deflect Missiles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp/20px-Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp/30px-Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp/40px-Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deflect Missiles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp/20px-Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles\" title=\"Deflect Missiles\">Deflect Missiles</a> feature except it does not allow throwing the missile back at the attacker.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can intercept missiles from ranged weapon attacks with a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a>, reducing their damage by <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/29px-D10_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/44px-D10_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/58px-D10_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/29px-D10_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/D10_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span><b>1d10</b> + your <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Score_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Score Modifier\">Dexterity modifier</a>. \n</p>\nYou can only reduce damage from the attack - any additional effects can't be negated.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/42px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_MAG_MissileSnaring</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_MAG_MissileSnaring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_MAG_MissileSnaring\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring\" title=\"Gloves of Missile Snaring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Missile_Snaring\" title=\"Gloves of Missile Snaring\">Gloves of Missile Snaring</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>You can only reduce damage from the attack - any additional effects can't be negated.</li>\n<li>However, if the attack does multiple types of damage (for example an <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Fire\" title=\"Arrow of Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Fire\" title=\"Arrow of Fire\">Arrow of Fire</a>), the damage reduction is applied separately to <i>each</i> type.</li>\n<li>Cannot be used while under the effects of any condition in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorph Beast Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_Beast_Shape_(status_group)\" title=\"Polymorph Beast Shape (status group)\">Polymorph Beast Shape</a></span> status group.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041517\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.077 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.082 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3057/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34019/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14635/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.031/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1357170/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   71.444      1 -total\n 98.83%   70.608      1 Template:Feature_page\n 79.87%   57.059     40 Template:Trim\n 29.43%   21.027      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 25.75%   18.395      3 Template:Item_icon\n 14.82%   10.590      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 11.82%    8.443      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.97%    6.406      1 Template:PageSeo\n  8.23%    5.880      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n  7.93%    5.667      6 Template:ItemIcon_Internal\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28312-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715041517 and revision id 374523. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}